# {{.ProjectName}}

A Go {{if .HasHTTP}}REST API{{else if .HasGRPC}}gRPC service{{else if .HasWorker}}consumer worker{{else}}service{{end}} built with Clean Architecture.

## Architecture

```bash
internal/
├── domain/                 # Layer 1: Enterprise Business Rules (innermost)
│   ├── entity/             # Business entities — pure Go structs, no framework tags
│   ├── identity/           # Authenticated principals + ctx plumbing
│   ├── security/           # Crypto port interfaces (PasswordHasher)
│   ├── user.go             # UserRepository interface + UserFilter
{{- if .HasMessageQueue}}
│   ├── user_publisher.go   # UserPublisher port + domain event structs
{{- end}}
{{- if .HasWorker}}
│   ├── user_audit.go       # UserAuditRepository port (audit trail)
{{- end}}
│   └── tx_manager.go       # TxManager port (WithinTx)
│
├── usecase/                # Layer 2: Application Business Rules
│   {{if .HasWorker}}├──{{else}}└──{{end}} user/               # Service (Register, Login, Get, Update, Delete, List)
{{- if .HasWorker}}
│   └── useraudit/          # Audit-trail service the worker dispatches into
{{- end}}
│
├── adapter/                # Layer 3: Interface Adapters
{{- if .HasMessageQueue}}
│   ├── pubsub/             # domain.UserPublisher over {{.MessageQueue}} + wire-format DTOs
{{- end}}
│   └── repository/
{{- if eq .Database "postgres"}}
│       ├── postgres/       # sqlc-backed UserRepository + TxManager + mapper
{{- end}}
{{- if eq .Database "mysql"}}
│       ├── mysql/          # sqlc-backed UserRepository + TxManager + mapper
{{- end}}
{{- if .HasRedis}}
│       {{if .HasElasticsearch}}├──{{else}}└──{{end}} redis/          # Cache-aside decorator over UserRepository (standalone)
{{- end}}
{{- if .HasElasticsearch}}
│       └── elasticsearch/  # User search index — Index/Delete/Search (standalone)
{{- end}}
│
├── transport/              # Inbound transport
{{- if .HasHTTP}}
│   └── http/
│       ├── router.go       # Framework instance + middleware order + Registrar interface
│       ├── health/         # /healthz (liveness) + /readyz (dependency probes)
│       ├── httpwriter/     # Framework-specific bind + response envelope writer
│       ├── middleware/     # RequestID, Logging, Recovery, CORS, Locale, Auth, LoginRateLimit
│       └── v1/             # v1.go: APIPrefix + Prefixed embed (one prefix per section)
│           └── user/       # Handler, Registrar (embeds v1.Prefixed), DTOs, assembler
{{- end}}
{{- if .HasGRPC}}
│   └── grpc/               # Service implementation
{{- end}}
{{- if .HasWorker}}
│   └── worker/             # Handler iface + Worker orchestrator + {{.MessageQueue}} consumer
│       └── v1/user/        # Per-feature message handler + DTO
{{- end}}
│
├── app/                    # Entry-point glue ({{if .HasHTTP}}RunHTTPServer{{else if .HasGRPC}}RunGRPCServer{{else}}RunWorker{{end}})
│
└── infrastructure/         # Layer 4: Frameworks & Drivers (outermost)
    ├── config/             # cleanenv + embed.FS (base/development/production)
    ├── database/           # {{.Database}} connection pool
    {{- if .HasRedis}}
    ├── cache/              # Redis client factory (single/sentinel/cluster)
    {{- end}}
    {{- if .HasElasticsearch}}
    ├── search/             # Elasticsearch client factory (ping on construct)
    {{- end}}
    {{- if .HasMessageQueue}}
    ├── pubsub/             # {{.MessageQueue}} producer{{if .HasWorker}} + consumer group{{end}} factory
    {{- end}}
    ├── jwt/                # TokenService (RS256 sign + verify)
    ├── logger/             # zerolog implementation of observability.Logger
    ├── security/           # bcrypt PasswordHasher implementation
    {{- if or .HasHTTP .HasGRPC}}
    ├── server/             # {{if .HasHTTP}}HTTP{{else}}gRPC{{end}} server lifecycle (graceful shutdown)
    {{- end}}
    ├── tracing/            # OpenTelemetry provider + cleanup
    └── di/                 # {{if .UseWire}}Wire-generated{{else}}Uber fx runtime{{end}} dependency wiring
```

